          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When you tap Send, Hex sends your message, the pictures above, your email, Hex's version and the language and speech model it dictates with, your iPhone's model, iOS version and language, the screen you opened this from, and a random install ID that keeps your reports together, to Anomaly's feedback inbox. Nothing you dictate or type elsewhere is sent." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "轻点“发送”后，Hex 会把你的留言、上面的图片、你的邮箱、Hex 的版本及其听写所用的语言和语音模型、你的 iPhone 型号、iOS 版本和语言、打开此页面的位置，以及一个把你的反馈归在一起的随机安装 ID 发送到 Anomaly 的反馈收件箱。你在别处听写或输入的内容都不会发送。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hex sends nothing unless you tap Send in Send feedback. The form lists exactly what goes with it. Your dictations, what you type and what Hex learned are never included." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "除非你在“发送反馈”中轻点“发送”，否则 Hex 不会发送任何内容。表单会列出随之发送的所有内容。你的听写、输入的内容以及 Hex 学到的内容都不会包含在内。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With an email, the team can reply. Without one, your feedback is anonymous." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "填写邮箱后，团队可以回复你。不填写，反馈就是匿名的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When you tap Send, Hex sends your message, the pictures above, Hex's version and the language and speech model it dictates with, your iPhone's model, iOS version and language, and the screen you opened this from to Anomaly's feedback inbox. Nothing you dictate or type elsewhere is sent." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "轻点“发送”后，Hex 会把你的留言、上面的图片、Hex 的版本及其听写所用的语言和语音模型、你的 iPhone 型号、iOS 版本和语言，以及打开此页面的位置发送到 Anomaly 的反馈收件箱。你在别处听写或输入的内容都不会发送。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
